province = 59
blurb = "Depicts Inuyama Dōsetsu, one of the \"eight dog\" heroes from the epic Hakkenden (\"Tale of Eight Dogs\"). He was a fire magician who traveled through villages to walk through fire in exchange for offerings.

Dōsetsu is dressed in the white robes of an ascetic and holds a pine sprig wrapped in an incantation between his teeth.

The left hand inset shows the Warabi village where the related chapter of the epic takes place. The name is a pun on \"straw fire\" which is visible amid the flames."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
